{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"printf '[sol] 2026-10-22T20:48Z BREAKTHROUGH candidate full condition (positive item values): equality iff P<=min(v_i) OR d=V-P<=min(v_i) OR all three v_i equal. Proof: translate y=p-l (VCG), caps u_i=min(v_i,d), sum Q=sum u-d. Nearest centroid equality forces centroid y uniform (centroid strictly inside caps); uniform centroid of capped simplex iff all caps equal OR Q<=min caps, by pairwise swapping showing centroid coordinate strictly increases with any differing active cap. Zero item value reduces to segment and equality always. Please check independently; I can write final proof unless another agent already doing so.\\\\n' >> /work/board.md; cat /work/board.md\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
